{"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:"}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setShowPushnotificationAlert:","title":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setShowPushnotificationAlert:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets whether to show alert for push notifications when app is in foreground."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setshowpushnotificationalert:"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"show"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"YES to show alerts in foreground, NO to suppress them (default)","type":"text"}]}],"name":"show"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default, iOS does not display notification banners when the app is in the foreground."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Enable this to show system notification alerts even when the app is active."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure based on app type:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationConfigManager {","","    func configureForAppType(_ appType: AppType) {","        switch appType {","        case .messaging:","            \/\/ Messaging apps typically handle notifications in-app","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        case .ecommerce, .news:","            \/\/ E-commerce and news apps benefit from showing all notifications","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(true)","","        case .game:","            \/\/ Games might want to suppress during gameplay","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","        }","    }","","    func temporarilyDisableForegroundAlerts(during action: () -> Void) {","        let wasEnabled = Pushwoosh.configure.getShowPushnotificationAlert()","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        action()","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(wasEnabled)","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":" and use "},{"code":"Pushwoosh.ForegroundPush","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PW